Package: kenyacensus
Type: Package
Title: Kenya Population and Housing Census Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Musa", "Rioba", email = "nyakerabachi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides comprehensive Kenya Population and Housing Census data 
    from 1948 to 2019. Includes national summaries, county-level breakdowns,
    demographic characteristics, education, housing, ICT access, employment,
    ethnicity, and disability statistics. All data sourced from the Kenya 
    National Bureau of Statistics (KNBS).
