Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    ggplot2
Suggests:
    testthat
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
URL: https://github.com/musanyaks/kenyacensus
BugReports: https://github.com/musanyaks/kenyacensus/issues